.SH NOTES
Unusually,
there is no
.B \%wbox
function;
.B \%box
behaves as one would expect
.B \%wbox
to,
accepting a
.I \%WINDOW
pointer argument.
.PP
.BR \%border ","
.BR \%box ","
.BR \%hline ","
.BR \%mvhline ","
.BR \%mvwhline ","
.BR \%vline ","
.BR \%mvvline ","
and
.B \%mvwvline
may be implemented as macros.
.PP
Borders drawn by these functions are
.I interior
borders.
.\" https://minnie.tuhs.org/cgi-bin/utree.pl?file=4BSD/usr/src/lib/libcurses/box.c
